type: image
style: illustration / watercolor sketch
aspect: 1:1
resolution: 1024x1024

prompt: |
  A small, friendly robot sitting at a workbench, assembling something from parts.
  Watercolor sketch style with visible pencil outlines — not polished, deliberately crafty.
  The robot has googly eyes and a body made of recycled parts: tin can torso, bottle cap buttons.
  Its hands are careful tweezers holding a tiny glowing component.
  Behind it: a cork board with pinned sticky notes reading "IDEAS", "TRY THIS", "v2.0".
  A small plant in a terracotta pot sits on the bench (nature meets machine).
  Warm, inviting colors: cork browns, sticky-note yellow, marker blue accents.
  Style: hand-drawn children's book illustration with a maker/STEM educational feel.
  NOT photorealistic. Deliberately imperfect, charming, approachable.

usage: Mascot illustration for the Workbench theme — onboarding, empty states, error pages.
